    "version": "1",
    "description": "We provide the raw experimental Fourier-transform microwave cavity jet spectra obtained with the QCUMBER setup obtained in G\u00f6ttingen. The data is divided into scans and single measurements. Experimental details like the number of averages are encoded in each file. For the scans this information can also be found in Electronic_lab_notebook.pdf. For the scans, only the subdirectories listed in Tab. S8 were used for fitting. The provided .dat files are native formats of the FTMW++ program of Jens-Uwe Grabow used to record the spectra. The program can be downloaded and installed on a Windows PC without any instrumentation free of charge. For a copy of the program you can contact the authors or contact Jens Grabow jens-uwe.grabow@pci.uni-hannover.de. See Melanie Schnell, Deike Banser, Jens-Uwe Grabow; \"Coaxially aligned electrodes for Stark-effect applied in resonators using a supersonic jet Fourier transform microwave spectrometer\" Rev. Sci. Instrum. 2004; 75 (6): 2111\u20132115. DOI: 10.1063/1.1755439 for details on the program.",
